# "A creature spell is any spell with the card type creature, even if it has other types" (ruling): Bot2 first casts Mox Jet,
# an artifact that is not a creature, and Essence Scatter is not offered against it (the refusal; the Mox resolves and
# Bot1 passes). Then Bot2 casts Ornithopter, an artifact creature, and Bot1 counters it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Essence Scatter
Essence Scatter
Island x3
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Swamp x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
? Stack = Mox Jet
! Bot1.Hand.Essence Scatter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
? Stack = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Essence Scatter.Cast(Ornithopter)

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Essence Scatter
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Jet
